OL,3,GNEWSAGiant lunar sculpture has visitors
OL,4,Aover the moon
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople visiting a large illuminated
OL,7,Fsculpture of the Moon have said it is
OL,8,Fan "amazing" sight.
OL,10,FArtHouse Jersey has brought Luke
OL,11,FJerram's artwork to the St Helier
OL,12,FMethodist Centre until Sunday 29
OL,13,FNovember.
OL,15,FThe 6m (20ft) wide display, which has
OL,16,Fbeen shown around the world, features
OL,17,Fdetailed imagery of the lunar surface
OL,18,Ffrom photographs by Nasa.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
