OL,3,GNEWSAGiant lunar sculpture has visitors
OL,4,Aover the moon
OL,5,
OL,6,FArthouse CEO Tom Dingle said:
OL,7,F"Something that makes the most of a
OL,8,Fpublic space, that makes us think about
OL,9,Fthe world around us, about ourselves,
OL,10,Fbut also something that we can all
OL,11,Fshare together all at once, is really
OL,12,Fexciting."
